            "id": 6667175,
            "title": "盤中速報 - 圓祥生技(6945)股價殺至跌停，跌停價108.0元，成交202張",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>圓祥生技(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6945:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6945\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6945-TW</a>)19日10:23下跌12元，股價跌停報108.0元，委買1,000張、委賣1,000張，成交202張。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>主要業務為新藥研發。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>圓祥生技(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6945:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6945\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6945-TW</a>)近5日股價上漲2.13%，櫃買市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>下跌10.62%，股價漲幅表現優於大盤。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>近5日籌碼</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>三大法人合計買賣超：-16 張</li> <li>外資買賣超：-16 張</li> <li>投信買賣超：0 張</li> <li>自營商買賣超：0 張</li> </ul></section></main>",
