        {
            "id": 6666908,
            "title": "〈台股開盤〉台股受權值股疲弱賣壓沉重 早盤重挫逾1500點貫破3萬9千點大關",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>AI股輝達(NADA-US)雖繳出優於預期的財報，但受黃仁勳去職影響，<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/DJI\">道瓊指數</a>周三(18日)仍持續走低，重挫逾560點，台股今(19)日開低走低，早盤在電子權值股受賣壓出籠影響，一度重挫1,500點，僅資安及電信類股表現較佳，盤中暫報39,008點下跌1,189點或2.96%，也貫破年線大關，單日成交量估1.07兆元。</p></section><p></p><div class=\"c1hvmcli\"><figure><div class=\"iirgi4a\"><img alt=\"cover image of news article\" src=\"https://cimg.cnyes.cool/prod/news/6666908/l/6087096b280914a55d28b2a15f11f34b.jpg\"/></div><figcaption class=\"c1gcnfq1\">台股受權值股疲弱賣壓沉重，早盤重挫逾1500點貫破3萬9千點大關。(鉅亨網資料照)</figcaption></figure></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>櫃買(OTC)指數則是開盤重挫逾6.4%，表現更弱於集中市場。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>電子權值股部分多檔盤中由紅翻黑，台積電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2330:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2330\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2330-TW</a>)下跌1.6%或40元，暫報2,135元；聯發科(2454 -TW)開高走低跌4.3%、日月光投控(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3711:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3711\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3711-TW</a>)重跌7%，鴻海(2317 -TW)跌1.13%、台達電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2317:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2317\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2317-TW</a>)跌4.2%，台光電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2383:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2383\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2383-TW</a>)遭恐慌下殺亮燈跌停。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>傳產金融權值股統一(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:1216:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/1216\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">1216-TW</a>)漲逾3%、兆豐金(2886 -TW)漲6.85%、和泰車(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2207:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2207\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2207-TW</a>)漲1.86%。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>資安股部分，受輝達驚傳遭知名勒索軟體組織The Gentlemen點名勒索，引發全球資安界高度關注，資安概念股逆勢上揚，包括意藍(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6925:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6925\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6925-TW</a>)漲8%，中華資安(7765 -TW)亮燈漲停、華經(2468 -TW)漲7%，博弘(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2317:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2317\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2317-TW</a>)漲3%，敦陽科(2480 -TW)、驊宏資(6148 -TW)漲2%。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>電信三雄則是成為資金避風港，中華電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2412:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2412\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2412-TW</a>)漲6%，遠傳(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:4904:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/4904\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">4904-TW</a>)、台灣大(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3045:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3045\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3045-TW</a>)漲幅超過2%。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>法人表示，台股短線技術面延續偏空不變，不排除持續測試年線至前低支撐可能，短線部分維持保守操作建議，若逢急跌可伺機搶短但應量力而為。</p></section><div class=\"ia49rhf\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>美股周三(18日)表現部分，<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/DJI\">道瓊指數</a>下跌 561.25 點或 1.11%，收50,198.17 點；<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/IXIC\">那斯達克</a>上漲101.5點或0.42%，收24,429.89點；<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/INX\">S&amp;P 500</a>指數下跌 16.9點或0.23%，收7,323.63 點；<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/SOX\">費半</a>指數上漲9.92 點或 0.1%，收9,652.8點。</p></section></main>",
            "link": "https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6666908",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-19 10:28:12",
            "source": "cnyes",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
